IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`
IMPORT `P4-gate`
IMPORT `P4-annex-xiv`

-- Tests of Annex XIV (consolidated lines 1958 to 2010). Expected values are written from the text.
-- The Omnibus took effect on 27 July 2026: 26 July 2026 is as enacted (the Annex is not in the text), 27 July 2026 is as amended.
-- Chapter III Section 4 applies from 2 August 2025: 1 August 2025 is before it applies.

§ `The table`

-- The Annex lists 22 codes: 11 under point 2.a, 3 under point 2.b, 1 under 3.a, 5 under 3.b, 1 under 3.c, 1 under 3.d.
GIVEN `the rows` IS A LIST OF `Annex XIV entry`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the number of rows` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the rows`
    WHEN EMPTY THEN 0
    WHEN x FOLLOWED BY rest THEN 1 PLUS `the number of rows` rest

#ASSERT `the number of rows` `Annex XIV as amended the entries` EQUALS 22
-- one assertion for each of the 22 codes: the type and the category, as the Annex words them
#ASSERT `Annex XIV as amended points 2 and 3 the type of AI systems the code stands for` "AIP 0102" EQUALS JUST "AI systems subject to point 2 of Section A of Annex I"
#ASSERT `Annex XIV as amended points 2 and 3 the type of AI systems the code stands for` "AIP 0103" EQUALS JUST "AI systems subject to point 3 of Section A of Annex I"
#ASSERT `Annex XIV as amended points 2 and 3 the type of AI systems the code stands for` "AIP 0104" EQUALS JUST "AI systems subject to point 4 of Section A of Annex I"
#ASSERT `Annex XIV as amended points 2 and 3 the type of AI systems the code stands for` "AIP 0105" EQUALS JUST "AI systems subject to point 5 of Section A of Annex I"
#ASSERT `Annex XIV as amended points 2 and 3 the type of AI systems the code stands for` "AIP 0106" EQUALS JUST "AI systems subject to point 6 of Section A of Annex I"
#ASSERT `Annex XIV as amended points 2 and 3 the type of AI systems the code stands for` "AIP 0107" EQUALS JUST "AI systems subject to point 7 of Section A of Annex I"
#ASSERT `Annex XIV as amended points 2 and 3 the type of AI systems the code stands for` "AIP 0108" EQUALS JUST "AI systems subject to point 8 of Section A of Annex I"
#ASSERT `Annex XIV as amended points 2 and 3 the type of AI systems the code stands for` "AIP 0109" EQUALS JUST "AI systems subject to point 9 of Section A of Annex I"
#ASSERT `Annex XIV as amended points 2 and 3 the type of AI systems the code stands for` "AIP 0110" EQUALS JUST "AI systems subject to point 10 of Section A of Annex I"
#ASSERT `Annex XIV as amended points 2 and 3 the type of AI systems the code stands for` "AIP 0111" EQUALS JUST "AI systems subject to point 11 of Section A of Annex I"
#ASSERT `Annex XIV as amended points 2 and 3 the type of AI systems the code stands for` "AIP 0112" EQUALS JUST "AI systems subject to point 12 of Section A of Annex I"
#ASSERT `Annex XIV as amended points 2 and 3 the type of AI systems the code stands for` "AIB 0201" EQUALS JUST "Remote biometric identification systems"
#ASSERT `Annex XIV as amended points 2 and 3 the type of AI systems the code stands for` "AIB 0202" EQUALS JUST "Biometric categorisation AI systems"
#ASSERT `Annex XIV as amended points 2 and 3 the type of AI systems the code stands for` "AIB 0203" EQUALS JUST "Emotion recognition AI systems"
#ASSERT `Annex XIV as amended points 2 and 3 the type of AI systems the code stands for` "AIH 0101" EQUALS JUST "AI systems based on symbolic AI, expert and knowledge-based systems, and AI systems based on search and optimisation"
#ASSERT `Annex XIV as amended points 2 and 3 the type of AI systems the code stands for` "AIH 0201" EQUALS JUST "AI systems that process structured data"
#ASSERT `Annex XIV as amended points 2 and 3 the type of AI systems the code stands for` "AIH 0202" EQUALS JUST "AI systems that process signal and audio data"
#ASSERT `Annex XIV as amended points 2 and 3 the type of AI systems the code stands for` "AIH 0203" EQUALS JUST "AI systems that process text data"
#ASSERT `Annex XIV as amended points 2 and 3 the type of AI systems the code stands for` "AIH 0204" EQUALS JUST "AI systems that process image and video"
#ASSERT `Annex XIV as amended points 2 and 3 the type of AI systems the code stands for` "AIH 0205" EQUALS JUST "AI systems that learn from their environment, excluding AI systems covered under AIH 0401"
#ASSERT `Annex XIV as amended points 2 and 3 the type of AI systems the code stands for` "AIH 0301" EQUALS JUST "generative AI systems, including AI systems based on general-purpose AI models"
#ASSERT `Annex XIV as amended points 2 and 3 the type of AI systems the code stands for` "AIH 0401" EQUALS JUST "AI systems based on other emerging AI technologies not covered by other codes, including Agentic AI"
#ASSERT `Annex XIV as amended points 2 and 3 the type of AI systems the code stands for` "AIP 0101" EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Annex XIV as amended points 2 and 3 the type of AI systems the code stands for` "" EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Annex XIV as amended points 2 and 3 the category of the code` "AIP 0102" EQUALS JUST "AI systems subject to Annex I"
#ASSERT `Annex XIV as amended points 2 and 3 the category of the code` "AIP 0112" EQUALS JUST "AI systems subject to Annex I"
#ASSERT `Annex XIV as amended points 2 and 3 the category of the code` "AIB 0201" EQUALS JUST "AI systems subject to point 1 of Annex III"
#ASSERT `Annex XIV as amended points 2 and 3 the category of the code` "AIB 0203" EQUALS JUST "AI systems subject to point 1 of Annex III"
#ASSERT `Annex XIV as amended points 2 and 3 the category of the code` "AIH 0101" EQUALS JUST "Symbolic AI and expert systems"
#ASSERT `Annex XIV as amended points 2 and 3 the category of the code` "AIH 0201" EQUALS JUST "Machine learning, excluding generative AI and general-purpose AI systems"
#ASSERT `Annex XIV as amended points 2 and 3 the category of the code` "AIH 0205" EQUALS JUST "Machine learning, excluding generative AI and general-purpose AI systems"
#ASSERT `Annex XIV as amended points 2 and 3 the category of the code` "AIH 0301" EQUALS JUST "AI systems based on general-purpose AI models or generative AI"
#ASSERT `Annex XIV as amended points 2 and 3 the category of the code` "AIH 0401" EQUALS JUST "Emerging AI technologies"
#ASSERT `Annex XIV as amended points 2 and 3 the category of the code` "nonsense" EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Annex XIV as amended points 2 and 3 the code is on the list` "AIH 0201" EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `Annex XIV as amended points 2 and 3 the code is on the list` "AIH 0206" EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `Annex XIV as amended points 2 and 3 the code is on the list` "aih 0201" EQUALS FALSE

§ `The dispatching functions: before and after the Omnibus, before and after the group applies`

-- the version: 26 July 2026 as enacted (NOTHING), 27 July 2026 as amended (the answer); 1 August 2025 the group does not apply (NOTHING)
#ASSERT `Annex XIV points 2 and 3 the code is on the list` (Date 27 7 2026) "AIH 0201" EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Annex XIV points 2 and 3 the code is on the list` (Date 27 7 2026) "AIH 0206" EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Annex XIV points 2 and 3 the code is on the list` (Date 26 7 2026) "AIH 0201" EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Annex XIV points 2 and 3 the code is on the list` (Date 1 8 2025) "AIH 0201" EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Annex XIV points 2 and 3 the code is on the list` (Date 2 8 2025) "AIH 0201" EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Annex XIV points 2 and 3 the code is on the list` (Date 1 12 2026) "AIB 0202" EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Annex XIV points 2 and 3 the type of AI systems the code stands for` (Date 27 7 2026) "AIB 0202" EQUALS JUST "Biometric categorisation AI systems"
#ASSERT `Annex XIV points 2 and 3 the type of AI systems the code stands for` (Date 26 7 2026) "AIB 0202" EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Annex XIV points 2 and 3 the type of AI systems the code stands for` (Date 1 8 2025) "AIB 0202" EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Annex XIV points 2 and 3 the type of AI systems the code stands for` (Date 27 7 2026) "AIB 0299" EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Annex XIV points 2 and 3 the category of the code` (Date 27 7 2026) "AIB 0202" EQUALS JUST "AI systems subject to point 1 of Annex III"
#ASSERT `Annex XIV points 2 and 3 the category of the code` (Date 26 7 2026) "AIB 0202" EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Annex XIV points 2 and 3 the category of the code` (Date 1 8 2025) "AIB 0202" EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Point 1`

-- args: date asked, the body has been designated, the activities are related to the types of AI systems concerned by the designation
#ASSERT `Annex XIV point 1 second sentence the conformity assessment body may carry out the conformity assessment` (Date 27 7 2026) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Annex XIV point 1 second sentence the conformity assessment body may carry out the conformity assessment` (Date 27 7 2026) TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Annex XIV point 1 second sentence the conformity assessment body may carry out the conformity assessment` (Date 27 7 2026) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Annex XIV point 1 second sentence the conformity assessment body may carry out the conformity assessment` (Date 27 7 2026) FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Annex XIV point 1 second sentence the conformity assessment body may carry out the conformity assessment` (Date 26 7 2026) TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Annex XIV point 1 second sentence the conformity assessment body may carry out the conformity assessment` (Date 1 8 2025) TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- args: date asked, the codes of the designation, the code of the type of AI systems concerned
#ASSERT `Annex XIV point 1 third sentence the type of AI systems is within the scope of the designation` (Date 27 7 2026) (LIST "AIH 0201", "AIB 0202") "AIB 0202" EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Annex XIV point 1 third sentence the type of AI systems is within the scope of the designation` (Date 27 7 2026) (LIST "AIH 0201", "AIB 0202") "AIH 0203" EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Annex XIV point 1 third sentence the type of AI systems is within the scope of the designation` (Date 27 7 2026) EMPTY "AIH 0203" EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Annex XIV point 1 third sentence the type of AI systems is within the scope of the designation` (Date 27 7 2026) (LIST "AIH 0201") "AIH 0299" EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Annex XIV point 1 third sentence the type of AI systems is within the scope of the designation` (Date 26 7 2026) (LIST "AIH 0201") "AIH 0201" EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Annex XIV point 1 third sentence the type of AI systems is within the scope of the designation` (Date 1 8 2025) (LIST "AIH 0201") "AIH 0201" EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Point 4`

-- args: date asked, the application specifies types of AI systems, the codes used in the application
#ASSERT `Annex XIV point 4 the application for designation uses the codes of the lists` (Date 27 7 2026) TRUE (LIST "AIH 0201", "AIP 0102") EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Annex XIV point 4 the application for designation uses the codes of the lists` (Date 27 7 2026) TRUE (LIST "AIH 0201", "XXX 0000") EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Annex XIV point 4 the application for designation uses the codes of the lists` (Date 27 7 2026) TRUE EMPTY EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Annex XIV point 4 the application for designation uses the codes of the lists` (Date 27 7 2026) FALSE EMPTY EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Annex XIV point 4 the application for designation uses the codes of the lists` (Date 26 7 2026) TRUE (LIST "AIH 0201") EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Annex XIV point 4 the application for designation uses the codes of the lists` (Date 1 8 2025) TRUE (LIST "AIH 0201") EQUALS NOTHING
-- The rule has no time limit and no consequence: FULFILLED when done, RESIDUAL otherwise; before the Omnibus and before the group applies nothing is owed.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Annex XIV point 4 the duty of the conformity assessment body to use the lists of codes` (Date 27 7 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Annex XIV conformity assessment body` DOES `Annex XIV 4 use the lists of codes, categories and corresponding types of AI systems when specifying the types of AI systems in the application for designation` AT 3
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `Annex XIV point 4 the duty of the conformity assessment body to use the lists of codes` (Date 27 7 2026) AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Annex XIV point 4 the duty of the conformity assessment body to use the lists of codes` (Date 26 7 2026) AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Annex XIV point 4 the duty of the conformity assessment body to use the lists of codes` (Date 1 8 2025) AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
